   "text": "Hostwise starts with what each guest actually loves:",
   "start": 16.6,
   "end": 19.6
  },
  {
   "text": "a couple of films,",
   "start": 19.88,
   "end": 21.07
  },
  {
   "text": "artists, shows or books.",
   "start": 21.1,
   "end": 22.83
  },
  {
   "text": "Each one is matched in Qloo's taste graph,",
   "start": 23.09,
   "end": 25.61
  },
  {
   "text": "and the names never leave your browser.",
   "start": 25.76,
   "end": 27.8
  },
  {
   "text": "Then the agent plans.",
   "start": 28.68,
   "end": 30.17
  },
  {
   "text": "It pools the whole table,",
   "start": 30.43,
   "end": 31.9
  },
  {
   "text": "scores every option against each guest on their",
   "start": 32.06,
   "end": 34.529999999999994
  },
  {
   "text": "own, and critiques its own pick.",
   "start": 34.55,
   "end": 36.8
  },
  {
   "text": "Here, The Smiths would leave Ana and Leila",
   "start": 37.12,
   "end": 39.449999999999996
  },
  {
   "text": "behind, so it re-plans from their side of",
   "start": 39.47,
   "end": 41.93
  },
  {
   "text": "the graph.",
   "start": 41.95,
   "end": 42.72
  },
  {
   "text": "You get seating built from what neighbours really",
   "start": 43.62,
   "end": 45.629999999999995
  },
  {
   "text": "share, a menu inferred from cross-domain taste and",
   "start": 45.65,
   "end": 49.04
  },
  {
   "text": "adapted to dietary needs,",
   "start": 49.06,
   "end": 50.9
  },
  {
   "text": "a soundtrack in three moods,",
   "start": 51.26,
   "end": 53.02
  },
  {
   "text": "and a film short enough for after dinner.",
   "start": 53.16,
   "end": 55.33
  },
  {
   "text": "And every pick shows its evidence:",
   "start": 56.23,
   "end": 58.28
  },
  {
   "text": "how well it fits each guest,",
   "start": 58.61,
   "end": 60.32
  },
  {
   "text": "which favourites pulled it in,",
   "start": 60.38,
   "end": 61.94
  },
  {
   "text": "and what a single pooled recommendation would have",
   "start": 62.23,
   "end": 64.54
  },
  {
   "text": "missed.",
   "start": 64.56,
   "end": 65.26
  },
  {
   "text": "Under the hood:",
   "start": 66.14,
   "end": 67.04
  },
  {
   "text": "Qloo search, insights with explainability,",
   "start": 67.31,
   "end": 70.04
  },
  {
   "text": "per-guest ranking, cuisine tag affinities and audience comparison.",
   "start": 70.21,
   "end": 74.33
  },
  {
   "text": "About fifty calls per evening,",
   "start": 74.61,
   "end": 76.55
  },
  {
   "text": "cached and rate-limited.",
   "start": 76.71,
   "end": 78.21
  }
 ]
}